  "notes": "<p>Reba did not contain the whistling ending. Your Pet Cat was last performed <a class=\"show-date-link\" href=\"https://phish.net/setlists/phish-august-16-2024-the-woodlands-dover-de-usa.html\" data-showdate=\"2024-08-16\">August 16, 2024</a> (100 shows). Happy Birthday to You was last performed <a class=\"show-date-link\" href=\"https://phish.net/setlists/phish-july-23-2023-st-josephs-health-amphitheater-at-lakeview-syracuse-ny-usa.html\" data-showdate=\"2023-07-23\">July 23, 2023</a> (155 shows). Mike teased the Reba whistling ending in the second Tweezer. Trey teased the theme from <i>The Twilight Zone</i> in Crosseyed. Fish quoted Crosseyed in Your Pet Cat. Page teased The Dogs and Your Pet Cat in the second Crosseyed. Carini contained a Crosseyed tease from Trey (with lyrics from the band.) Chalk Dust Torture and the fourth Tweezer featured Trey on mini drum kit.&nbsp;</p>",
